    "chunk_text": "so\u00f0 God & so\u00f0 mann geboren, Dauides So\u00f0f\u00e6stnysse he h\u00e6f\u00f0, swa he sylf s\u00e6de: Ego sum uia, & ueritas, & uita: Ic sylf eom se weg, & \u00d0urh Moysen w\u00e6s gesett \u00feam ealdum mannum iu \u00e6, & open lagu, & se leofa H\u00e6lend gebrohte us \u00d0am is wuldor & lof & wyr\u00f0mynt on ecnysse mid \u00feam heofonlican F\u00e6der & \u00feam Halgan Gaste on.",
